{
  "uid": "hz-simulator-context",
  "title": "Simulator Run Context",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-5m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "tags": [
    "hazelcast",
    "simulator",
    "run-context"
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "cluster",
        "label": "Cluster",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(hz_runtime_uptime, mc_cluster)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(hz_runtime_uptime, mc_cluster)",
          "refId": "SV"
        },
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "refresh": 2,
        "hide": 0,
        "current": {
          "text": "workers",
          "value": "workers"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "member",
        "label": "Member",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(hz_runtime_uptime{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\"}, mc_member)",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(hz_runtime_uptime{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\"}, mc_member)",
          "refId": "SV"
        },
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "refresh": 2,
        "hide": 0,
        "current": {}
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Hazelcast Simulator Run Context\n\nSimulator-oriented dashboard that correlates cluster behavior with client activity and failover symptoms. It intentionally uses generic Hazelcast metrics present in the MC scrape rather than workload-specific application metrics.\n\n**Key questions this dashboard answers:**\n- Is the client/load generator connected?\n- Did a member/DC failover reduce cluster size or trigger migrations?\n- Did throughput, queueing, retries, or timeouts change during the run?\n- Did the cluster recover to a stable member count and quiet migration state?"
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Run Connectivity",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cluster Size",
      "description": "Current member count.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(hz_cluster_size{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\"})",
          "legendFormat": "members",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 2
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Client Connections",
      "description": "Client endpoint count as seen by the cluster.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(hz_client_endpoint_count{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\"})",
          "legendFormat": "clients",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Map Operation Rate",
      "description": "Total AP map operation rate across get/put/set/remove/other.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(hz_map_getCount{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\", name!~\"^_.*\"}[$__rate_interval])) + sum(rate(hz_map_putCount{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\", name!~\"^_.*\"}[$__rate_interval])) + sum(rate(hz_map_setCount{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\", name!~\"^_.*\"}[$__rate_interval])) + sum(rate(hz_map_removeCount{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\", name!~\"^_.*\"}[$__rate_interval])) + sum(rate(hz_map_numberOfOtherOperations{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\", name!~\"^_.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "ops/s",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Pending Invocations",
      "description": "Current pending invocations.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(hz_operation_invocations_pending{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\"})",
          "legendFormat": "pending",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 100
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Cluster Size and Clients",
      "description": "Timeline of member and client count. Use this to mark failover/recovery windows.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(hz_cluster_size{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\"})",
          "legendFormat": "members",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(hz_client_endpoint_count{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\"})",
          "legendFormat": "clients",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Workload Throughput",
      "description": "AP map operation throughput from cluster-side counters.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(hz_map_getCount{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\", name!~\"^_.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "get/s",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(hz_map_putCount{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\", name!~\"^_.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "put/s",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(hz_map_setCount{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\", name!~\"^_.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "set/s",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(hz_map_removeCount{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\", name!~\"^_.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "remove/s",
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Failover Signals",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Partition Recovery",
      "description": "Migration activity that should spike during member/DC failure and return to zero.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(hz_partitions_migrationActive{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\"})",
          "legendFormat": "active",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(hz_partitions_migrationQueueSize{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\"})",
          "legendFormat": "queue",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(hz_partitions_totalCompletedMigrations{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "completed/s",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Reliability Counters",
      "description": "Timeout, retry, and failed-backup rates during the run.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(hz_operation_failedBackups{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "failed backups/s",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(hz_operation_invocations_backupTimeouts{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "backup timeouts/s",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(hz_operation_invocations_normalTimeouts{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "normal timeouts/s",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(hz_operation_retryCount{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "retries/s",
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 3
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Member Heap During Run",
      "description": "Heap pressure by member during load and failover.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "100 * hz_memory_usedHeap{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\", mc_member=~\"$member\"} / clamp_min(hz_memory_maxHeap{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\", mc_member=~\"$member\"}, 1)",
          "legendFormat": "{{mc_member}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Operation Queue During Run",
      "description": "Total operation and response queue depth.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 30,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(hz_operation_queueSize{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\"}) + sum(hz_operation_priorityQueueSize{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\"})",
          "legendFormat": "operation queues",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(hz_operation_responseQueueSize{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\"})",
          "legendFormat": "response queue",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(hz_operation_invocations_pending{mc_cluster=\"$cluster\"})",
          "legendFormat": "pending invocations",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
